                         Registration information
                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Why register???

If you register you will get :

 o A personal version of PrO-DmScHeCk
 o Your BBS number appearing at the bottom of track zero's
 o Optionally the upload date and/or time can be added to the banners.
 o At least one update to PrO-DmScHeCk
 o A disk containing unregistered versions of my other Ami-Express doors,
         with the registered version of PrO-DmScHeCk


How much is it to register ?

Registration is £5.00 (Five UK pounds)

How do I register then ?

Print out (or write by hand) the file 'Register.doc' and mail it to me
(see contacting me), along with the 5 pounds in CASH, and you will recieve
the latest registered version via return of post.... if your BBS is in
the UK then I will personally call and upload the latest version.


