                 interface.

BullRead       : Bulletins door for /X that allows users to search
                 bulletins while they are on-line, or download the bulletins
                 for viewing whilst off-line.

X-Zippy        : Replacement zippy search door for /X that can search
                 for multiple items at a time, about 3 times faster
                 than the built in zippy!!

UserCom        : Door for /X that allows users to make comments to files
                 so that others will know if the file is old, fake etc.

PrO-DmScHeCk   : DMS file checker - for user with most BBS systems.
                 Strips and adds front, rear and track texts.

PrO-LhAcHeCk   : LHa file checker - for user with most BBS systems.
                 Strips most other adverts and adds own adverts that are
                 virtually unstrippable.

PrO-LogInfo    : An Ami-Express door to inform on-line users when another
                 user logs on to, or off from, another node.

Decrunch       : CLI based decruncher to decrunch loads of different
                 packed files.

PPPatch        : PowerPacker Patcher... Patches the headers of PowerPacked
                 files so that they can't be decrunched.

